 # `narwhals.selectors`
 
+The following selectors are all supported. In addition, just like in Polars, the following
+set operations are supported:
+
+- set intersection: `&`
+- set union: `|`
+- set difference: `-`
+- complement: `~`
+
 ::: narwhals.selectors
     handler: python
     options:
